  m_text: '<size=120%><b>Color Vision Quiz</b></size>

    The Challenge: You will
    be presented with 16 statements regarding human color perception, Deuteranopia,
    Protanopia, and Tritanopia.


    The Rules:


    Decide if each statement is
    True or False.


    Once you begin, you must complete the quiz to see your final
    score.


    Your final score will be saved to the Global Leaderboard.


    Can
    you separate fact from fiction? Click START below to begin!'
